 cancer  whistler on the other hand notices  karen's bite marks and tells her that  she only has at least two days before  fully transforming into a vampire  blade goes outside and meets with frost  at the park he invites blade to join him  convincing him that he would not be  received by humankind because of his  mixed origins  blade refuses which causes frost to be  angry  turns out he heads to whistler and  karen's hideout karen just discovers a  cure for herself but it does not give  the same effect on blade's blood sample  they are surprised by frost's ambush  frost tortures whistler and abducts  karen then leaves  when blade arrives he finds whistler  severely injured whistler explains that  blade's blood is the key piece that  frost needs to complete his ritual of  summoning la magra and start a vampire  apocalypse he forbids blade to chase  after frost again but blade refuses  then realizing his wounds are too  damaged whistler asks for blade's gun so  he can commit suicide before turning  into a vampire then he prepares for an  ambush on frost's base and packs karen  said to serums as one of his weapons  frost brings karen to his lavish  penthouse and explains to her that he  believes vampires are the superior race  on the planet  blade intrudes frost's base and defeats  several of his men  he learns that karen's serums work as  the vampires he injects them with  eventually explode when entering frost's  bedroom he learns that his mother is  still alive  she looks young and undamaged even  embraces her new identity as a vampire  frost appears and hurts him from behind  exclaiming that he was the vampire who  bit his mother years ago the vampire  that blade has been looking for all his  life he throws blade into a dungeon with  karen when the ritual is about to begin  at the temple of eternal night they are  separated blade is taken by his mother  to a cage where his blood will be  drained to supply the ritual while karen  is taken to a cell  there she discovers that her past  co-worker curtis survived the vampire  attack but he is now transformed into a  zombie-like creature she outsmarts him  and escapes from the cell then quickly  heads to fine blade frost has gathered  the pure blood vampire elders as his 12  sacrifices for the lamagra ritual  blade's blood spills through the wall  then trickles into each of the  sacrifice's foreheads then the  sacrifice's lives are drained away while  frost starts to gain the full power of  the blood god  karen finds blade and frees him who is  in a very weak condition  she deduces he will die by his lack of  blood and suggests he bites her to  consume some of her blood and regain his  strength  he does it and his super strength is  restored  then he encounters his mother and  defeats her he continues defeating  frost's henchmen one by one until only  frost remains challenging him to a duel  blade learns that frost cannot be  defeated by weapons as he can easily  regenerate his body and sustain any  damage  he notices his edta serums being stuck  in the temple walls and aims to loosen  them  frost thinks blade wants the serum to  enhance his strength but he attacks  frost with all those syringes  the overdose of etta causes frost's body  to inflate and eventually explode blade  picks karen up and they escape from the  temple  karen explains that she can continue  working to find a cure for blade but  blade is concerned that his war against  vampires is not yet over  he proposes she work on a better serum  instead that he can use against evil  vampires  sometime later he intercepts a brief  vampire attack in moscow russia  subscribe to watch more videos like this  turn on notifications and leave a like  to help the channel out thank you for  watching
 

